==Event Information==
Wow! {{Color|#FF00FF|'''25 Million Downloads'''}} Worldwide!<br>
Time to celebrate!!!

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Login between October 3rd (11:00am) and 17th (11:00am) to join in on the party!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Cat Food presents every day!'''}}<br>
Boot up The Battle Cats app to collect a reward of {{Color|#008000|'''20 Cat Food'''}} each day of the campaign! Check in and profit!

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Special Celebration Stages!'''}}<br>
The baddest of the bad and the worst of the worst are here to take down the Cat Army! Will you let them defeat your Cat Army?!<br>
Visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages during this event period to take on the {{Color|#FF0000|'''25M Downloads: Deadly Carnival 2'''}}, in addition to the classic {{Color|#FF0000|'''Deadly Carnival'''}}!<br>
Clear the first stage of {{Color|#FF0000|'''Deadly Carnival 2'''}} for a reward of 3 Normal Tickets, then clear the second stage for a Rare Ticket prize!<br>
Don't miss out on this awesome chance for tickets!<br>
<small><small>※If this event does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.<br>
※Rewards will only be received upon the first stage clear.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Spring - Summer Monthly Event Stage Revival!'''}}<br>
Monthly Events from {{Color|#008000|'''May through September are back!'''}}<br>
Clear these limited stages to pick up special units!
・Monthly Event Schedule<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''October 3rd (11:00am) through October 10th (10:59am)'''}}<br>
　{{Color|#FF0000|'''May, June, and July Stages, all available at once!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''October 10th (11:00am) through October 17th (10:59am)'''}}<br>
　{{Color|#FF0000|'''August and September Stages, all available at once!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Catamin/Catseye Limited Capsule Events!'''}}
On the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between normal Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit/Catseye Limited Capsules'''}}!<br>
Speed up your Gamatoto! Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!<br>
<small><small>※The Catseye Limited Capsules provide Catseyes and XP rewards, while Catamin Limited Capsules will provide Catseyes and XP!<br>
※The Catamin Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 1 is completed. Catseye Limited Capsules will appear after Rank 1600 is reached in The Battle Cats.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Half-Off Energy for Story Mode Chapters!'''}}<br>
Conquer the Future and the Past!<br>
On Even Days, play {{Color|#008000|'''"Empire of Cats"'''}} Stages for {{Color|#FF00FF|'''half the Energy cost'''}}, or login on Odd Days to play {{Color|#FF00FF|'''"Into the Future" Stages'''}} at a special Energy discount!<br>
Clear the Story Modes to power up your Cats with Treasure and XP!<br>
<small><small>※Clear Empire of Cats Ch. 1 to receive the Half-Off Energy benefit.<br>
※If this event does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.</small></small>

